    "body": "> This ticket initially at least was specifically for the case where pipenv has put the venv in the project dir (`PIPENV_VENV_IN_PROJECT=1`) so hopefully this sort of helps with that.\r\n\r\nAnd it literally says that in the title :facepalm: \r\n\r\n> Unfortunately they way we call external binaries at the moment that won't work since it will try to execute the binary `\"$(pipenv --where)/bin/python\"` and fail to find it in the PATH or relative directories.\r\n\r\nYeah, that's what I assumed. I should have put _wishful thinking_ mark there. :upside_down_face: ",
